{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins with a modest sales job, cold-calling potential clients to sell them stocks. From there, you\u2019ll step into the world of trading, property investment, and business operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze information, anticipate market shifts, and time your trades to maximize profit. Spot undervalued properties, negotiate deals, and generate steady rental income. Expand your operations, manage resources, and make choices that shape your path to fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The economy is ever-changing \u2014 news events, market sentiment, and unexpected crises can all create risk or opportunity. It\u2019s up to you to read the signals, seize the moment, and turn your ambition into lasting wealth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-path Investing</strong> \u2013 Engage in stock trading, real estate investment, and business management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Information-Driven Decisions</strong> \u2013 Analyze news and events to predict market movements before they happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Market</strong> \u2013 Prices, sentiment, policies, and crises evolve over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Zero to Wealth</strong> \u2013 Start small and steadily grow your assets through smart choices.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956440?t=1756772636","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956440?t=1756772636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956440/e4005c8cd7655c91de083382ae0c5de3ec82b69f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756772636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste